  <yt:channelId>UCuAXFkgsw1L7xaCfnd5JJOw</yt:channelId>
  <title>Rick Astley - Angels On My Side (Live at The O2, London, April 2026)</title>
  <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PXC_PYeB6F8"/>
  <author>
   <name>Rick Astley</name>
   <uri>https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCuAXFkgsw1L7xaCfnd5JJOw</uri>
  </author>
  <published>2026-06-26T16:00:07+00:00</published>
  <updated>2026-09-10T08:22:25+00:00</updated>
  <media:group>
   <media:title>Rick Astley - Angels On My Side (Live at The O2, London, April 2026)</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/PXC_PYeB6F8?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/PXC_PYeB6F8/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Taken from Rick Astley’s sold-out Reflections Tour, this live performance of “Angels On My Side” was recorded at London’s O2 Arena in April 2026.

Originally featured on Rick’s chart-topping album 50, this live version of &quot;Angels On My Side&quot; is now included on the 10th Anniversary Deluxe Edition of 50, celebrating a decade since the album’s release.

50 (10th Anniversary Deluxe Edition) is out now via BMG.

Buy/Stream: https://rickastley.lnk.to/50Anniversary

